<%# Phase 15F: security & privacy note shown at the bottom of every Email Settings tab. %>
<div class="bw-note">
  <span class="bw-note__icon">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
  </span>
  <div>
    <strong>Security &amp; Privacy.</strong>
    Email settings and templates are owner-only. The SMTP password is write-only — it is never shown after
    saving and never logged. Email content may contain <code>{{variables}}</code> that are replaced when sending.
  </div>
  <span class="bw-note__meta">All times shown in the server timezone</span>
</div>
